{"4393300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Culinary Mayhem", "steam_appid": 4393300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Culinary Mayhem</strong></i> provides a new take on the Boomer Shooter Genre by combining all the speed and chaos of fast paced shooters like <i>ULTRAKILL</i>, <i>Doom Eternal</i>, and <i>Quake</i> with a dreamscape where food is your enemy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a chef that has lost their reputation, constantly having nightmares about losing your Stars. One day you fall asleep at your restaurant and fall in a terrible nightmare where your fighting the ingredients that you cook. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go get your Stars back.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Purée</strong> all the food in your dreams with your kitchen based weapons!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash through your enemies to take bites out of them for health!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wall run to evade enemy attacks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete levels fast to get more Stars back!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill fast and make it out of your dream!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a student made game for the University of Utah Undergrad program.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Culinary Mayhem</strong></i> provides a new take on the Boomer Shooter Genre by combining all the speed and chaos of fast paced shooters like <i>ULTRAKILL</i>, <i>Doom Eternal</i>, and <i>Quake</i> with a dreamscape where food is your enemy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a chef that has lost their reputation, constantly having nightmares about losing your Stars. One day you fall asleep at your restaurant and fall in a terrible nightmare where your fighting the ingredients that you cook. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go get your Stars back.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Purée</strong> all the food in your dreams with your kitchen based weapons!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash through your enemies to take bites out of them for health!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wall run to evade enemy attacks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete levels fast to get more Stars back!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill fast and make it out of your dream!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a student made game for the University of Utah Undergrad program.</p>", "short_description": "Culinary Mayhem is a stylized, fast-paced shooter, where food is your enemy. That is inspired by other FPS games in this genre. Quickly Pulverize all the food in your dreams with kitchenware to help the Chef get his Stars back.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393300/27db7373b84dbe9e9fe6e847c144b0d4cb7078f5/header.jpg?t=1777403243", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393300/dba4dc16aa6d392aa58a7fc28033f7f45b0248bb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777403243", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393300/dba4dc16aa6d392aa58a7fc28033f7f45b0248bb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1777403243", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 9 5900HS<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX 1060 Mobile</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [